{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2021-08-25 09:30:00', 'title': 'COLGATE-PALMOLIVE WEBCASTS FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BARCLAYS 2021 GLOBAL CONSUMER STAPLES CONFERENCE', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COLGATE-PALMOLIVE (NYSE:CL) CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT AND CEO, NOEL WALLACE, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A VIRTUAL FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BARCLAYS 2021 GLOBAL CONSUMER STAPLES CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, SEPTEMBER 8, 2021 AT 9:20 AM ET. INVESTORS MAY ACCESS A LIVE WEBCAST OF THIS FIRESIDE CHAT ON COLGATE'S WEBSITE AT WWW.COLGATEPALMOLIVE.COM. FOR THOSE UNABLE TO PARTICIPATE DURING THE LIVE WEBCAST, A RECORDED VERSION OF THE WEBCAST WILL BE MADE AVAILABLE THROUGH THE INVESTOR CENTER PAGE"}